+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN BEHAVIOR -->
+### Behavior
+
+Interrupted confirmation restarts the timer. Once cancellation starts, the request remains until stock cruise reports OFF.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END BEHAVIOR -->
+
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN USAGE -->
+### Usage
+
+Default OFF. Enable only for Porter II EV with SpeedFromPCM=0. Switching OFF does not re-engage cruise; the driver decides when to use cruise again.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END USAGE -->
+
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN REFERENCE -->
+### Reference
+
+Cancellation does not brake or stop the vehicle. It uses the existing button path, so stock vehicle acceptance still requires validation.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END REFERENCE -->
